  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement and development of rural infrastructure (with WB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">administration agreement will be signed between the European Commission and the World Bank , which will complement the on-going WB Municipal Services Improvement Project (MISP) which finances investments in municipal services and infrastructure . It will allow access to funds to those rural and poorer municipalities which cannot currently access WB loans</narrative>
